		(uuid "bb696e36-0a96-5910-b1cc-036883b652cc")
	)
	(text "I2C map: 0x20/21/22 TCA9554, 0x2C TAS5805M, 0x39 APDS-9960, 0x5A DRV2605L, 0x6A LSM6DSOX, power IC TBD (check)."
